    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Private end-terrace home in a peaceful cul-de-sac just off Booterstown Avenue and within walking distance of the coast, all within easy reach of public transport, excellent schools and local amenities.\n\nProperty briefly consists of an entrance hallway, a living room with a glass door out to the front patio, and a wood burning stove, a separate kitchen/dining room with access to a small rear yard. There is a large master bedroom, a smaller second bedroom and a new modern bathroom with a walkin shower unit.The private front patio will catch the sunshine all day long. The house comes with one undesignated parking space. \n\nSituated in a tranquil Booterstown cul-de-sac within walking distance of the DART, coastal walks, Blackrock and Booterstown villages, this home enjoys easy access to excellent local schools, and is a 10 minute walk to the N11 and a wide range of local amenities, with local shops just around the corner.\n\nIn short, this is a fine house in great location and viewing is highly recommended. To arrange a viewing please contact Ryan O`Shaughnessy or call the office on 01 2951001."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living room - 4.02m (13'2\") x 4.04m (13'3\")\nCarpets. Blinds, Light pendant and ceiling spotlights. Wood burning stove. Good shelving and storage\n\nKitchen/dining room - 3.83m (12'7\") x 2.07m (6'9\")\nLino flooring. Light pendant. High gloss kitchen cabinets. Counter splash back tiles. Gas boiler. Frosted door out to rear yard.\n\nBathroom - 1.78m (5'10\") x 2.68m (8'10\")\nFloor to ceiling tiles. Walk-in shower with large glass shower screen. Large mirror with integrated light. Large sink with under counter storage. Heated towel rail. Ceiling light fitting. Extractor fan.\n\nMaster bedroom - 5m (16'5\") x 2.73m (8'11\")\nDual aspect. Carpets. Net curtains. Light pendant.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.38m (11'1\") x 2.1m (6'11\")\nCarpets. Blind. Light pendant. Built-in wardrobes.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Beautifully presented private home </li><li> Located at the rear of a secluded estate </li><li> Sun kissed private front patio </li><li> Bright living space with a wood burning stove </li><li> New modern bathroom </li><li> Large dual aspect bedroom </li><li> Ample undesignated parking </li><li> Short walk to Booterstown Avenue </li><li> Easy access to the N11 and the DART</li></ul>"
      },
